Package: openbox
Version: 3.6.1
Architecture: aarch64
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: NuxDroid <nuxdroid@local>
Depends: nuxdroid-desktop-libs, coreutils
Description: Stacking window manager for the NuxDroid desktop.
 Packaged with a touch-friendly default configuration: root menu with
 application launcher, workspace switching keybinds and the nuxdroid-session
 startup script used by the embedded X server.
